data/cow-territorial/
# Ancient World Mapping Center geodata (ODbL 1.0; Roman provinces, Alexander, Persia...): git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/AWMC/geodata.git data/awmc
data/awmc/
# CHGIS V6 time-series prefecture polygons, 221 BCE-1911 (non-commercial academic/educational use only; no
# redistribution; cite "CHGIS Version 6." (c) Fairbank Center for Chinese Studies and the Institute for Chinese
# Historical Geography at Fudan University, Dec 2016): https://dataverse.harvard.edu/api/access/datafile/2966510
data/chgis/

# Deep-time page, raw sources (not committed):
